    {"id":"wt-l24","from_ref":"wt-e-green-ridge-east-coast","to_ref":"wt-e-east-sea","relation":"directly_meets","direction":"east","summary":"青脊山東側山體直接落入東海。"},
    {"id":"wt-l25","from_ref":"wt-e-green-ridge","to_ref":"wt-s-black-marsh","relation":"bounds","direction":"east","summary":"青脊山南段從東側壓縮水尾澤水網。"},
